  <item>
    <title>Vol.17 女孩们的漫游与清醒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b96109caaea1fb3bc77cc1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b96109caaea1fb3bc77cc1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Mar 2026 14:39:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>温温 × 桃桃的 Girls Trip 开场 —— 我们去大理啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>桃桃分享东京之旅：购物天堂实锤！但……垃圾桶去哪儿了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>认真聊聊：如果要长居，我们适合住在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>二月回顾：今年美加春节都放假了！顺便聊聊「家庭主妇」的工作价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>经济下行期生存指南：我们如何做好“过冬”准备？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>温温多年后首次回老家过年：一转眼，小朋友都长大了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>小朋友玩剧本杀遇到“坏老板”：关于陌生人警惕心的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>意外入坑！温温爱上短剧：怎么会这么上头？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>妇女节特别讨论：意识在觉醒，路还很长，不过依然充满希望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>“女司机技术差？”我们来聊聊生活中女人承受的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>现在的小朋友恋爱观好健康：喜欢就要说出来！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e1278b29a508c6d1b50792/lh1R18vodl5Ynz0E1YFBDf-c77UL.m4a" length="47593681" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:00</itunes:duration>
