  <item>
    <title>Vol.10-十期同行，属于我们的2024</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676bcc2415a5fd520e7a908f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676bcc2415a5fd520e7a908f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Dec 2024 09:27:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一不小心拖到了现在</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢可爱的听众朋友给了我们动力：）</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家圣诞快乐！新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">1:10</a>” 琼瑶阿姨离世，大家开始重新审视她的作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">4:30</a>” 我们的思想也在不断变化，愤怒未必是坏事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">6:15</a>” 桃桃又又又毕业啦！三十岁从学校回到职场，顾虑不少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">8:45</a>” 对于中国式好学生而言，上班还是比上学爽啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a>” 温温今年反向润回了上海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>” 温温回国工作后终于吃上了公司食堂，很满意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a>” 国内生活太多姿多彩啦，人还是要多多挪窝，多多city walk</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>” 温温在今年被选召创业啦，学习新鲜事物非常有成就感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a>” 三十岁重启人生，不破不立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a>” 作为温柔的平方（女团），今年也是对我们意义重大的一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a>” 决定做播客了之后，我们女团叭叭叭的频率也急剧增加了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a>” 播客坚持十期啦，感谢支持我们的听众朋友们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a>” 畅想一下退休生活，希望能够财务自由，做自己喜欢的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>” 三十岁回看十八岁，长大真好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>” 祝大家新年快乐！！圣诞快乐！！明年再见啦：）</span></p>]]></description>
