  <item>
    <title>Vol.08-琼瑶式爱情——浪漫背后的女性力量</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67165a310d2f24f289c34e3d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67165a310d2f24f289c34e3d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Oct 2024 13:42:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这一期温温和桃桃又团聚啦！！</span></p><p><span>让我们一起来聊一下《还珠格格》和《情深深雨濛濛》等经典琼瑶作品，如何通过追求爱情和自我价值来挑战封建社会。 希望有不同意见的小伙伴不要生气~我们一起探讨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">0:10</a>” 温温和桃桃再次合体，暴走波士顿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">1:15</a>” 对琼瑶作品的第一印象： 文笔太棒了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">2:45</a>” 为什么现在的作家文笔不行了呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a>” 很遗憾，琼瑶阿姨的私生活传闻走在了作品前头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">7:30</a>” 童年经典还珠格格：在女性作家的笔下，女孩子们各有各的美好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>” 她们追求的不仅仅是爱情，还有追爱的权利，以及对于自我价值的肯定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>” 小燕子是封建制度的挑战者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a>” 情深深雨濛濛：差点站错cp啦！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a>” 依萍，初代大女主</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a>” 大陆版情深深雨濛濛时代背景的改编是点睛之笔：由小情小爱走向家国情怀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>” 新月格格：我是来加入这个家的，不是来破坏这个家的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a>” 琼瑶笔下的人物是复杂的，即使有一些炸裂情结，但我们认为瑕不掩瑜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>” 有道德瑕疵的人可以作为主角么？韦小宝 vs 紫菱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>” 如懿传——用封建反琼瑶，有点拧巴，也有点可惜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a>” 如懿传其实在专注反还珠格格</span></p><p><span>37“30 主创对于令妃的恶意让他们忽略了叙事逻辑：封建社会里，最大反派不是皇帝or太厚，竟是出身低微的小宫女？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a>” 那拉氏是一个被如懿传的真爱逻辑浪费的人物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a>” 长月烬明和如懿传有一样的问题，浪费了演员和设定（此处口误了：坏女配不是魔神庶出的大姐，是魔神老婆庶出的大姐）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 聊聊知否：我俩都是剧粉，但看的时候也觉得怪怪的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a>” 庶女和妾室，她们是被压迫的群体</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a>” 知否的结局：在祠堂自焚的女人和被重建的祠堂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3294">54:54</a>” 从琼瑶到反琼瑶，原因是有哪些呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a>” 大婆教和雌竞的背后有太多委屈和眼泪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">60:30</a>” 电视剧推荐时间！！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltDAwZG5h5jephaTW2GAU7aG6QYW.m4a" length="64223675" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVblbJ_PnlypMjWcRSWXG_pj4i0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.07-此心安处，我在食物里寻找归属感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d9ef84bfd7110df48f8860</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d9ef84bfd7110df48f8860</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 17:51:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>温温和桃桃在这一期里分享了留学后关于吃饭的辛酸史。</span></p><span></span><p><span>例如异国他乡尝试了各种菜肴,为了融入，觉得自己可以不吃中餐，但始终发现，中国胃的偏好难以改变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，我们终于意识到，我们好像不再需要通过饮食去迎合或融入某种文化，而是可以安心地享受那些承载着记忆与情感的家乡味道，从而找到属于自己的归属感。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">0:30</a> 初学做饭的趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 异国他乡的中国元素给游子们带来很多安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a>桃桃留学时第一次在国外吃中餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">4:30</a> 温温在小伦敦的满江红回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a> 出国留学治愈了温温和桃桃的挑食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> 没有中超太不方便，桃桃十年没吃着青笋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">9:45</a>胃的记忆不会改变，除了中餐一切都是将就</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a>食物和记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 聊聊美式中餐，橘子鸡也不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>没有中国菜的时候，走哪个城市都会泡在中国城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 所在城市中餐好不好吃决定留子地位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 聊聊幸运饼干</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 歪果仁吃中餐分餐吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a>恋爱的时候，吃在一起很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a>好吃的肉在国外很难买</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 聊聊徐州的羊肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 这几年香港的川菜变多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 聊聊我们在海外最想念的国内美食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> 中外甜品差别很大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a>热量刺客：意面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a>健康生活和效率是比较难平衡的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 自己做饭了之后理解了妈妈的辛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a>国内的外卖太发达了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a>食欲代表什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 食物是爱意含蓄的表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> 承认对于中餐的喜爱是和自己的和解</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmUEDBViOdE3OMdPAPT7czX4tQ8h.m4a" length="56360689" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtevgNHN8EEAGC-MbTnT7BxlnzIY.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.06-润与反向润: 勇气的两种表达</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c21d1b33591c27beff42e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c21d1b33591c27beff42e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Aug 2024 16:11:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>温柔的瓶方已经坚持到第六期啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一个月更节目，这意味着我们已经坚持了半年。非常感谢每一位听友的支持（深深鞠躬）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期温温和桃桃在多伦多团聚啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们还邀请了一位特别嘉宾——毛毛。原本我们还想着要录Vlog，但姐妹们相聚实在太开心了，把其他的都忘得一干二净，只顾着蛐蛐别人了（不是）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然啦！我们也一起录了这期节目，讨论了一些热点话题。毛毛还分享了她的亲身经历。国内还是国外，我们到底该如何选择？真的有一种选择是最适合我们的吗？虽然答案可能不尽如人意，但无论选择哪一种道路，都愿我们永远有勇气面对未来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐是我们三个人一直很喜欢的一首合唱曲目，曾轶可和刘忻的《Forever 21》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家一切顺利，永远都有勇往直前的勇气！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">1:03</a>欢迎特别嘉宾毛毛，一个从加拿大润回国又从国内润回加拿大的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">1:39</a> 本期话题：润和反向润</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a> 润前需要考虑的几个因素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">3:15</a> 毛毛润回国的心路历程：想卷！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">4:45</a> 加拿大的office lady生活和电视剧演的不一样啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 回到中国，毛毛得偿所愿，却发现现实很骨感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 反向文化冲击带来的焦虑：事业，年龄，婚恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 离开梦想中的工作，毛毛去了甲方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 甲方乙方，各有各的累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> 办公室政治这事，国外也不少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1811">30:11</a> 回国三年，毛毛选择重回加拿大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 加拿大最近也变卷了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 润还是不润，这是个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a>年龄这事，在国外焦虑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 世界是个围城，没有绝对的完美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 毛毛征婚/找工作广告时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a> 祝大家都能遇到善良真诚的人/老板</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lre6Cgj1KgNnjHXVDJm33TwC010W.m4a" length="51509836" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjmYHaypv1I70MYDPUdQsuSOgyzr.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.05-北美适应指南：融入环境，我们需要改变自己吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669e6eca37236c546ef6de75</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669e6eca37236c546ef6de75</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Jul 2024 14:38:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>七月末啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道小伙伴们的夏天过得怎么样啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一个月里，桃桃和温温一直在生病，希望大家也要多注意身体哦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们重点聊聊国外生活。对于每个留学生来说，融入当地环境是出国的第一课。面对人生地不熟的环境和陌生的语言文化，我们是否需要改变自己来更好地融入呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>”这一个月的相关的碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a>” 本期主题：融入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a>” 融入的第一挑战：语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a>” 点餐真的很难哎！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a>” 语言是个沟通工具而已，能传达意思就好，不要过度渴求语法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a>” 平常心看待口音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a>” 老美也有口音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a>” 勇敢说出“听不懂”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 融入的第二挑战：文化— 你们的笑话我听不太懂哎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 笑不明白咋办呢？ 直接问就好啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a>” 少问 vs 多问：温温的工作经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a>” 课上没有蠢问题，勇敢问教授</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a>“ 强烈推荐family guy来学梗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>” 种族歧视：可怼可举报，勇敢捍卫自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a>” 找工作的文化差异：coffee chat</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a>” 温温的networking经验：珍惜每个机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>” Job Fair 小贴士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a>” 聊聊同事相处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a>” 桃桃的经验：选城市还蛮重要的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>” 为了融入，我们需要改变吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a>” 自己舒服最重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a>” 结语：勇敢一些，抬头挺胸接受赞美</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsyPztneq7BwDl4iBFnGol1NilJv.m4a" length="52571739" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVblbJ_PnlypMjWcRSWXG_pj4i0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.04-从这里开始：我们的北美故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666f4a96b6a84127293313ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666f4a96b6a84127293313ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 20:27:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>做了四个月播客才想起来并没有向大家介绍我们自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>那今天就来讲讲我们两的故事和为什么开始做播客吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容有部分关于美国法学院和加拿大CPA-如果有不对的地方欢迎大家指出哦（所有内容仅代表个人观点）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">1:11:00</a> - 温温和桃桃，十一年的老留子 种种原因被动选择出国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13627">3:47:7</a> - 国际高中的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23266">6:27:46</a> - 回国卷吗？习惯成自然，或许也没那么糟。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28329">7:52:9</a> - 大学生活，小鬼当家的日子开始了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32160">8:56:00</a>’ - homestay生活，论人品爆发的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> - 桃桃的本科生活，表演+播音双重语言训练暴击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a>- 温温本科选择了会计，因为会计数学比较简单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> - 从表演到法律，桃桃的职业跨度也没那么大 &amp; 震惊！在美国，这些律师只能理科生来做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> - 成熟点之后学法律也挺不错的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1303">21:43</a> - 简单聊聊美国法学院申请, 其实法学院很简单，学习就好啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> - 美国JD究竟是啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> - 聊聊工作：再次震惊！桃桃放弃了美国公务员铁饭碗选择了税法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> - 温温作为加拿大cpa现身说法；亲娘咧，还是没逃过高考： 会计师资格证和美国律师资格证考试经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a> - 考试难还是工作难？当然是考试嘛！+ cpa canada居然内部打起来了耶！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>- 做播客的初衷：和老朋友聊聊天嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> - 对播客未来的展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> - 下期主题：交个朋友吧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpcGnmm2AbIHF3kIBZS_1f8sc59Z.m4a" length="55642227" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjmYHaypv1I70MYDPUdQsuSOgyzr.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.03-夏天快乐！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664dfa1bc59d1e5757fc8ba4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664dfa1bc59d1e5757fc8ba4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2024 13:58:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们回来啦！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>忙碌了好久总算有时间坐下聊聊天了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里我们先恭喜桃桃毕业啦！！（鼓掌！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们聊一聊这短暂而让人充满期待的夏天~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslpxcsQWeBxgaCgawsVoRvU14Rh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 爱暑假，爱夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">4:00</a> 留子的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">5:35</a> 过期的火锅底料依然好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a> 留学十年—漫长的夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">9:10</a> summer camp</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 短暂而热烈的夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 终于可以穿裙子啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 夏天的烟火气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 夏天的动漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a> 还珠格格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 琼瑶的观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 聊聊知否</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 暑期档对我们的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a> 夏天衣服的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 快餐文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 今年的计划-看看祖国的大好河山！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 适合恋爱的夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 记得吃冰淇淋哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 关于夏天的moment</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 夏天和西瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a>阳光很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 夏天的歌</span></p>]]></description>
